| How do we efficiently discover and track 500 milli | Great Solution: Chrome Extension + Selective Crawling | Good Solution: Prioritized Crawling Based on User Interest | Better scalability and reliability |
| How do we handle potentially malicious price updat | Great Solution: Trust-But-Verify with Priority Verification | Good Solution: Consensus Based Validation | Better scalability and reliability |
